{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrow Dungeon\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced action roguelike where every shot counts.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a weathered archer, making one final descent into a cursed dungeon teeming with monsters, traps, and mystery. With only a limited number of arrows, every encounter becomes a tactical challenge of movement, timing, and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore shifting labyrinths cloaked in darkness, where light is your only ally and every shadow may conceal your doom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, adapt, and discover ancient relics to push deeper into the depths\u2014until either glory or death awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfaf <strong>Tactical Arrow-Based Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Use limited arrows and recover them mid-combat. Every shot must be aimed, recovered, or replaced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf11 <strong>Darkness as a Mechanic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Fight and explore in pitch-black dungeons. Use torches, magical light, and fire arrows to survive in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83e\udde0 <strong>Dynamic Monsters and Bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Enemies react to your movement and light. Face a variety of adaptive foes and multiple unique bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83e\udded <strong>Procedurally Generated Dungeons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every run is different\u2014explore branching paths, hidden chambers, traps, and random events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \u2699\ufe0f <strong>Skill Unlock and Gear-Based Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Earn new active skills and equip powerful gear that changes your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Challenge Modes and Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Conquer time trials, resource restrictions, and other special modes to test your mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to descend into the dark with only your bow and wits?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrow Dungeon</strong> awaits. Every shot is survival. Every run is your story.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Goblin Shaman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761740/d6be0fb0fc6387ac05607acae7d7139eef802b6f.jpg"},{"name":"Goblin Chieftain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761740/e87dc9c03bf97e67044ec859525de9af398d3014.jpg"},{"name":"Goblin Sniper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761740/b3509e67e6523edd7d86f967f15161ef1a8a30ca.jpg"},{"name":"Dungeon Visitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761740/49c42b5673b945efced9bf990c7b41260a44f34d.jpg"},{"name":"Progressed Dungeon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761740/9beb16db47c6ca54b5c95126f640356e958f4925.jpg"},{"name":"Rampage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761740/e5487d23567f42136393d85311d9bf7037092e60.jpg"},{"name":"Chicken stick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761740/2c799d5693128f7bfbe2157d59a8bbeb65b4ce4f.jpg"},{"name":"Squick squick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761740/bc94b6e71ff1ac083697efef521fe1f10afc5bbb.jpg"},{"name":"Head shot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761740/e2c1e29e37c23eb46dfd2cdf4a754666d1a450a2.jpg"},{"name":"The Sorcerer\u2019s Wraith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761740/6101b9a327103e9e178f42a47e7d698ee42e48cd.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761740?t=1751011428","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761740?t=1751011428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761740/0754b4471f63ded2213e2486a7f4c9cd91f6062f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751011428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761740/0754b4471f63ded2213e2486a7f4c9cd91f6062f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751011428","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Arrow Dungeon contains mild fantasy violence, such as combat using arrows and encounters with fantasy monsters including skeletons and ghosts. There is no blood, gore, or realistic depictions of injury. The game also features a dark dungeon setting that may be slightly unsettling for younger players, but it does not include any explicit content, sexual acts, or depictions of drug use, abuse, or self-harm."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrow Dungeon\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced action roguelike where every shot counts.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a weathered archer, making one final descent into a cursed dungeon teeming with monsters, traps, and mystery. With only a limited number of arrows, every encounter becomes a tactical challenge of movement, timing, and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore shifting labyrinths cloaked in darkness, where light is your only ally and every shadow may conceal your doom.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, adapt, and discover ancient relics to push deeper into the depths\u2014until either glory or death awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfaf <strong>Tactical Arrow-Based Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Use limited arrows and recover them mid-combat. Every shot must be aimed, recovered, or replaced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf11 <strong>Darkness as a Mechanic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Fight and explore in pitch-black dungeons. Use torches, magical light, and fire arrows to survive in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83e\udde0 <strong>Dynamic Monsters and Bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Enemies react to your movement and light. Face a variety of adaptive foes and multiple unique bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83e\udded <strong>Procedurally Generated Dungeons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every run is different\u2014explore branching paths, hidden chambers, traps, and random events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \u2699\ufe0f <strong>Skill Unlock and Gear-Based Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Earn new active skills and equip powerful gear that changes your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Challenge Modes and Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Conquer time trials, resource restrictions, and other special modes to test your mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to descend into the dark with only your bow and wits?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrow Dungeon</strong> awaits. Every shot is survival. Every run is your story.</p>","developers":["ParkDol"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761740/f249c87609629a98b0e797e8999ee8138cee4143/header.jpg?t=1751011428","is_free":false,"linux